{"id":"wb-7-1137","name":"重兴塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"重兴塔","text":"重兴塔，位于山东省济宁市邹城市城区，是一座宋代佛塔，1985年公布为济宁市重点文物保护单位，2006年公布为山东省文物保护单位，2013年5月公布为全国重点文物保护单位。\n\n重兴塔始建于北宋初年，为楼阁式砖塔，平面八角，九层，高27.4米。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%87%8D%E5%85%B4%E5%A1%94","revisionId":88055856,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88055856","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/4a38eae8baba63520d9ba4ac.jpg","title":"Zoucheng_Chongxing_Ta_2015.08.14_17-37-54.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zoucheng_Chongxing_Ta_2015.08.14_17-37-54.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b8/Zoucheng_Chongxing_Ta_2015.08.14_17-37-54.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"邹城重兴塔","width":320,"height":213}}